#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:4
msgid "Schema Configuration Classes"
msgstr "模式配置类"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:6
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab's spawners author USD physics attributes onto prims via a layered "
"set of configuration classes. The layering separates **universal-physics** "
"parameters from **backend-specific** parameters, so the same asset cfg can "
"be authored once and target any backend that supports it."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 的生成器通过分层配置类，将 USD 物理属性写入 prim。分层结构区分 **通用物理** 参数与 **后端特有** "
"参数，使同一资产配置只需编写一次，就能用于所有支持它的后端。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:11
msgid ""
"This page explains the class hierarchy, when to use each tier, and how "
"parameters route to the underlying USD attributes."
msgstr "本页介绍类的继承关系、各层的适用场景，以及参数如何对应到底层 USD 属性。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:14
msgid ""
"Migrating from 2.x? See :ref:`schemas-cfg-refactor` in the 3.0 migration "
"guide."
msgstr "从 2.x 迁移？请参阅 3.0 迁移指南中的 :ref:`schemas-cfg-refactor` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:17
msgid "Quick example"
msgstr "快速示例"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:19
msgid "Add MuJoCo (MJC) gravity compensation to an articulated asset:"
msgstr "为关节体资产添加 MuJoCo（MJC）重力补偿："

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:35
msgid ""
"The Mujoco-specific fields land under ``mjc:*`` on the prim; any "
"``RigidBodyBaseCfg`` / ``JointDriveBaseCfg`` fields you set on the same "
"instance land under ``physics:*``. See :ref:`schema-cfgs-mixed` for the full"
" routing rules."
msgstr ""
"MuJoCo 特有字段写入 prim 的 ``mjc:*`` 命名空间；在同一实例上设置的 ``RigidBodyBaseCfg`` / "
"``JointDriveBaseCfg`` 字段则写入 ``physics:*`` 。完整规则见 :ref:`schema-cfgs-mixed` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:40
msgid "Class hierarchy"
msgstr "类的继承关系"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:42
msgid ""
"For each property group (rigid body, joint drive, collision, articulation "
"root, material, mesh collision), Isaac Lab defines a single base class in "
"core ``isaaclab.sim.schemas`` and one subclass per backend in the "
"corresponding extension package:"
msgstr ""
"对于各属性组（刚体、关节驱动、碰撞、关节体根节点、材质和网格碰撞），Isaac Lab 在核心包 ``isaaclab.sim.schemas`` "
"中定义一个基类，并在对应扩展包中为各后端定义子类："

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:80
msgid ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonMeshCollisionPropertiesCfg` uses "
"multiple inheritance: it extends both "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonCollisionPropertiesCfg` (for "
"``contact_margin`` / ``contact_gap``) and "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.MeshCollisionBaseCfg` (for "
"``mesh_approximation_name``). This is the textbook case for the per-"
"declaring- class MRO routing described under :ref:`schema-cfgs-mixed` — each"
" inherited field is written under the namespace of the class that declared "
"it. :class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonSDFCollisionPropertiesCfg` is"
" collision-rooted, so it authors ``NewtonSDFCollisionAPI`` without also "
"applying ``UsdPhysics.MeshCollisionAPI`` or setting "
"``physics:approximation``."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonMeshCollisionPropertiesCfg` "
"使用多重继承，同时继承 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonCollisionPropertiesCfg` （提供 "
"``contact_margin`` / ``contact_gap`` ）和 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.MeshCollisionBaseCfg` （提供 "
"``mesh_approximation_name`` ）。这是 :ref:`schema-cfgs-mixed` 所述按声明类及 MRO "
"进行属性分发的典型案例：每个继承字段都写入声明该字段的类所对应的命名空间。 "
":class:`~isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas.NewtonSDFCollisionPropertiesCfg` "
"以碰撞配置为根，因此编写 ``NewtonSDFCollisionAPI`` 时，不会同时应用 "
"``UsdPhysics.MeshCollisionAPI`` 或设置 ``physics:approximation`` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:92
msgid ""
"The hierarchy is **single-rooted per spawner slot**: every spawner has a "
"single field for each property group (``rigid_props``, "
"``joint_drive_props``, ``collision_props``, etc.), and Python's polymorphism"
" allows any subclass to be passed where the base type is expected."
msgstr ""
"该继承体系 **在每个生成器配置槽位上只有一个根类** ：各生成器为每个属性组提供一个字段（ ``rigid_props`` 、 "
"``joint_drive_props`` 、 ``collision_props`` 等）。Python 的多态允许在期望基类的位置传入任意子类。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:98
msgid "When to use which class"
msgstr "何时使用哪种类"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:100
msgid ""
"The choice depends on which backends you target and which fields you need."
msgstr "选择取决于目标后端和所需字段。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:102
msgid ""
"**Use a base class** (``RigidBodyBaseCfg``, ``JointDriveBaseCfg``, etc.)"
msgstr "**使用基类** （ ``RigidBodyBaseCfg`` 、 ``JointDriveBaseCfg`` 等）"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:103
msgid ""
"when you only need universal-physics fields and you want your asset cfg to "
"be backend-portable. Importing the base class does not pull in "
":mod:`isaaclab_physx` or :mod:`isaaclab_newton`."
msgstr ""
"适用于只需要通用物理字段，并希望资产配置可跨后端使用的情况。导入基类不会连带导入 :mod:`isaaclab_physx` 或 "
":mod:`isaaclab_newton` 。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:107
msgid "**Use a PhysX subclass** (``PhysxRigidBodyPropertiesCfg``, etc.)"
msgstr "**使用 PhysX 子类** （ ``PhysxRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`` 等）"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:108
msgid ""
"when your asset uses PhysX-specific knobs (per-body damping, TGS solver "
"iterations, sleep / stabilization thresholds, torsional patch friction, "
"compliant-contact materials, etc.) and you target the PhysX backend. "
"Inherits all base-class fields, so you can set both universal and PhysX "
"fields on the same instance."
msgstr ""
"适用于目标为 PhysX 后端、且资产需要 PhysX 特有参数的情况，例如逐刚体阻尼、TGS "
"求解器迭代次数、休眠/稳定化阈值、扭转接触面摩擦和柔顺接触材质等。子类继承全部基类字段，因此可在同一实例上同时设置通用和 PhysX 字段。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:114
msgid "**Use a Newton subclass** (``NewtonRigidBodyPropertiesCfg``, etc.)"
msgstr "**使用 Newton 子类** （ ``NewtonRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`` 等）"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:115
msgid ""
"when you target Newton and need Newton-native attributes "
"(``newton:contactMargin``, ``newton:torsionalFriction``, "
"``newton:selfCollisionEnabled``, etc.). The empty Newton base classes "
"(``NewtonRigidBodyPropertiesCfg``, ``NewtonJointDrivePropertiesCfg``) "
"reserve the ``newton:*`` namespace for future native fields and act as the "
"parent for solver-specific subclasses."
msgstr ""
"适用于目标为 Newton，且需要 ``newton:contactMargin`` 、 ``newton:torsionalFriction`` 、 "
"``newton:selfCollisionEnabled`` 等 Newton 原生属性的情况。空的 Newton 基类（ "
"``NewtonRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`` 、 ``NewtonJointDrivePropertiesCfg`` "
"）为未来原生字段预留 ``newton:*`` 命名空间，并作为求解器特有子类的父类。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:122
msgid ""
"**Use a MuJoCo subclass** (``MujocoRigidBodyPropertiesCfg``, "
"``MujocoJointDrivePropertiesCfg``)"
msgstr ""
"**使用 MuJoCo 子类** （ ``MujocoRigidBodyPropertiesCfg`` 、 "
"``MujocoJointDrivePropertiesCfg`` ）"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:123
msgid ""
"when you specifically use Newton's **MuJoCo** solver and need MuJoCo-only "
"knobs (gravity compensation via ``mjc:gravcomp`` / "
"``mjc:actuatorgravcomp``). Inherits from the Newton base, so "
"``isinstance(cfg, NewtonRigidBodyPropertiesCfg)`` is True."
msgstr ""
"适用于明确使用 Newton 的 **MuJoCo** 求解器，且需要 MuJoCo 专属参数的情况，例如通过 ``mjc:gravcomp`` / "
"``mjc:actuatorgravcomp`` 实现重力补偿。它继承 Newton 基类，因此 ``isinstance(cfg, "
"NewtonRigidBodyPropertiesCfg)`` 为 True。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:129
msgid "What parameters live where"
msgstr "参数分别属于哪些类"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:133
msgid ""
"The tables below summarize which fields live on which cfg classes. The "
"canonical source is the auto-generated API reference — see "
":doc:`/source/api/lab/isaaclab.sim.schemas`, "
":doc:`/source/api/lab_physx/isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas`, and "
":doc:`/source/api/lab_newton/isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas`, which render the "
"cfg class docstrings directly. Treat these tables as a navigation aid; if "
"they drift from the source, the API docs win."
msgstr ""
"下表概括各配置类包含的字段。权威来源是自动生成的 API 参考： :doc:`/source/api/lab/isaaclab.sim.schemas`"
" 、 :doc:`/source/api/lab_physx/isaaclab_physx.sim.schemas` 和 "
":doc:`/source/api/lab_newton/isaaclab_newton.sim.schemas` "
"直接呈现配置类的文档字符串。这些表格仅供查找；如果与源代码不一致，以 API 文档为准。"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:142
msgid "Universal physics (declared on the base class)"
msgstr "通用物理（在基类上声明）"

#: source/concepts/schema_cfgs.rst:144
msgid ""
"Lives on the **base class**. Most fields write to ``physics:*`` (the "
"standard ``UsdPhysics.*API`` namespace), but a small set of \"exception\" "
"fields are declared on the base for backend-portability yet route to a "
"non-``physics:*`` namespace because that is the only USD path honored today "
"(e.g., ``disable_gravity`` writes ``physxRigidBody:disableGravity`` because "
"both PhysX and Newton's importer consume the PhysX attribute). The \"USD "
"attribute\" column below is the actual emitted attribute, not the namespace "
"family."
msgstr ""
"位于 **基类** 。大多数字段写入 ``physics:*`` （标准 ``UsdPhysics.*API`` "
"命名空间），但少数“例外”字段为了跨后端可用而声明在基类上，实际却写入其他命名空间，因为目前只有这些 USD 路径受到支持。例如， "
"``disable_gravity`` 写入 ``physxRigidBody:disableGravity`` ，因为 PhysX 和 Newton "
"导入器都会读取这个 PhysX 属性。下表的“USD 属性”列给出实际写出的属性，而非命名空间类别。"

